Optional per-pipeline wait budget for VIctory-NVIDIA

Base: trustno1-coder/VIctory-NVIDIA 63b902fe1720a5188ee79d94a88c8de0470f6349
Adapted from: https://github.com/Maykzera/victory-rtx3060/blob/44fed2c78cc851d9bcf218ba48d705b5defc4d97/crates/victory-gpu/src/pipeline/make.rs
Enable with VICTORY_PIPELINE_WAIT_ONCE=1. This version reserves wait time under the existing shared budget lock and uses the per-pipeline cap for ordinary pipelines.

